Agent Kit Manager — manage reusable LLM skills, artifacts, and instructions

Usage: akm [COMMAND]

Commands:
  setup         Interactive feature configuration
  config        View, get, or set configuration values
  sync          Sync all enabled features (skills, artifacts, instructions)
  update        Check for a new release and self-update the akm binary
  skills        Skills management (defaults to `status` when no subcommand is given)
  artifacts     Artifact sync
  instructions  Global instruction management
  completions   Generate shell completion script
  disable       Turn off shell integration so harnesses run vanilla (reversible)
  enable        Re-enable shell integration after `akm disable`
  uninstall     Remove akm from this machine
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Examples:
  akm setup                      # interactive feature configuration
  akm sync                       # sync all enabled features
  akm skills add vitest tdd      # add specs to project manifest
  akm skills list --type skill   # list all skills
  akm skills import <github-url> # import a skill from a GitHub URL
  akm artifacts sync             # sync artifacts repo
  akm config artifacts.auto-push false
